      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Unfortunately, I encountered one of the retailers that gives the industry a bad name.I had agreed upon a 12kW system. Come the installation day, without any prior notice, the installers appeared with the wrong colour panels and the wrong size inverter.I did not allow the installation to proceed.Nothing was said about the agreed sized Fronius inverter not being available, despite the considerable period of time between the deposit being paid (contract date) and the installation date .Afterwards, I was offered all sorts of \"bait and switch\" options: lowered powered REC panels, different brand panels, and an inferior Huawei inverter as the Fronius inverter agreed upon was not available anytime soon.  I said I was not interested in these, but what was agreed upon.  As there was no serious intention to secure the agreed inverter and panels, despite me having to follow up repeatedly, I requested to cancel the system and requested a refund on my deposit.  However, the manager/owner claims he doesn't legally have to refund my deposit.  Still waiting on the return of my deposit.This is a salient warning to others to avoid this unscrupulous operator.",
